      "proposed_content": "The proposed chain would combine nonnegative coefficients with Landau's boundary theorem to constrain local Euler roots, but the exact automorphic parent establishes only the Rankin-Selberg positivity input. It does not contain the claimed Landau application, the required global convergence/singularity analysis, or the resulting uniform finite-place bound.",
